1. GOTO url: "https://www.sarwa.co/login"
2. PAUSE_FOR_USER reason: "AUTHENTICATION_RECAPTCHA_AND_OTP"
3. NOTE The user completes login, reCAPTCHA, and OTP in the headed window; never type, inspect, copy, log, or store any authentication value.
4. ASSERT condition: "authenticated Sarwa dashboard visible"
5. NOTE Capture holdings and account values in USD with an as-of timestamp. Keep only a user-approved account label or last four digits; never record a full account number or session state.
